2:16.091" end="2:26.850" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.091" end="2:16.937">Pâinea</span> <span begin="2:16.937" end="2:20.747">speranței</span> <span begin="2:20.747" end="2:21.170">s-o</span> <span begin="2:21.170" end="2:21.594">duc</span> <span begin="2:21.594" end="2:26.850">tuturor!</span></p><p begin="2:26.850" end="2:37.111" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.850" end="2:28.133">Deschide</span> <span begin="2:28.133" end="2:31.553">cerul</span> <span begin="2:31.553" end="2:31.981">și</span> <span begin="2:31.981" end="2:32.836">ia-mă</span> <span begin="2:32.836" end="2:33.263">la</span> <span begin="2:33.263" end="2:37.111">Tine,</span></p><p begin="2:37.111" end="2:47.372" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:37.111" end="2:38.394">Scurtează-mi</span> <span begin="2:38.394" end="2:41.814">drumul</span> <span begin="2:41.814" end="2:42.242">cel</span> <span begin="2:42.242" end="2:43.097">aspru</span> <span begin="2:43.097" end="2:43.524">și</span> <span begin="2:43.524" end="2:47.372">lung!</span></p><p begin="2:47.372" end="2:57.633" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.372" end="2:48.655">Arată-mi,</span> <span begin="2:48.655" end="2:52.075">Doamne,</span> <span begin="2:52.075" end="2:52.503">că</span> <span begin="2:52.503" end="2:52.930">Tu</span> <span begin="2:52.930" end="2:53.358">ești</span> <span begin="2:53.358" end="2:53.785">cu</span> <span begin="2:53.785" end="2:57.633">mine,</span></p><p begin="2:57.633" end="3:04.474" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.633" end="2:58.916">Deschide-mi</span> <span begin="2:58.916" end="3:02.336">cerul,</span> <span begin="3:02.336" end="3:03.619">acasă</span> <span begin="3:03.619" end="3:04.474">s-ajung!</span></p></div></body></tt>